{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01433",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 5.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I've settled them in, ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.56,
      "end_seconds": 11.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Thanks. Hello, come in, sit down. What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.24,
      "end_seconds": 21.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.37,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got watery eyes. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.56,
      "end_seconds": 25.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.56,
      "end_seconds": 29.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "It's been about a month now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.5,
      "end_seconds": 33.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.93,
      "end_seconds": 46.48,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly. And, And blurred vision after the screen, too. Actually, uh, I've also had sore, gritty eyes, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.43,
      "end_seconds": 51.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.45,
      "end_seconds": 55.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.15,
      "end_seconds": 60.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.33,
      "end_seconds": 65.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "I have eczema, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.71,
      "end_seconds": 72.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.75,
      "end_seconds": 79.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "I, I have gout, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.12,
      "end_seconds": 84.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Alright, gout, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.82,
      "end_seconds": 104.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.19,
      "end_seconds": 114.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "Uh, I had my tonsils removed as a teenager. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.64,
      "end_seconds": 125.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.44,
      "end_seconds": 136.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.61,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed for the eczema. Allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.37,
      "end_seconds": 140.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.91,
      "end_seconds": 152.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days. I hardly move around during the day. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.09,
      "end_seconds": 156.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Has there been any eye pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.62,
      "end_seconds": 163.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, not that I've noticed, no eye pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.62,
      "end_seconds": 169.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Have you had any flashing lights, sensitivity to light or loss of vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.02,
      "end_seconds": 180.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "I mean, no flashing lights, sensitivity to light or loss of vision, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.61,
      "end_seconds": 184.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.26,
      "end_seconds": 188.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Actually, no, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.17,
      "end_seconds": 194.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.1,
      "end_seconds": 198.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 199.5,
      "end_seconds": 205.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pressure 122 over 80, saturation 99 percent, heart rate 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.4,
      "end_seconds": 208.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.8,
      "end_seconds": 212.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.96,
      "end_seconds": 215.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.66,
      "end_seconds": 229.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "The eyes are slightly red with no discharge and the front of the eye looks clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.17,
      "end_seconds": 240.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Having listened and examined, I'd lean towards dry eye syndrome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.77,
      "end_seconds": 244.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.86,
      "end_seconds": 255.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like dry eye syndrome, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.86,
      "end_seconds": 275.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "I think an eye test makes sense here, for blurred vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.83,
      "end_seconds": 279.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Right, you know, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.59,
      "end_seconds": 301.34,
      "duration_seconds": 20.75,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is lubricant eye drops, 1 drop, four times a day, long term. It's for dry eyes. Take a screen break every twenty minutes and try to blink fully. I'd like to see you again in four weeks. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.31,
      "end_seconds": 304.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "That's clear, uh, thanks."
    }
  ]
}